### 7.1 User Engagement
- **Daily Active Users (DAU)**: Target 40% of registered users during season
- **Session Duration**: Average 8+ minutes per session
- **Pick Submission Rate**: 85%+ of eligible users submit picks on time
- **Pool Completion Rate**: 75%+ of users complete pools they enter
- **Social Engagement**: 30%+ of users participate in chat/comments

### 7.2 Financial Performance
- **Revenue Growth**: 25% month-over-month during season
- **Average Revenue Per User**: $150+ per season
- **Transaction Success Rate**: 99%+ payment processing success
- **Withdrawal Processing**: 95%+ processed within SLA
- **Support Ticket Volume**: <5% of active users require support

### 7.3 Technical Performance
- **App Performance**: 99.5%+ uptime during peak hours
- **Crash Rate**: <0.1% of app sessions
- **API Response Time**: <500ms for 95% of requests
- **App Store Rating**: Maintain 4.5+ stars
- **Load Time**: App startup in <3 seconds

## 8. Risk Assessment and Mitigation

### 8.1 Legal and Regulatory Risks
- **Risk**: Changing gambling regulations could limit operations
- **Mitigation**: Legal monitoring, compliance consulting, market diversification

### 8.2 Technical Risks
- **Risk**: Data provider outages during critical games
- **Mitigation**: Multiple data sources, manual backup procedures

### 8.3 Financial Risks
- **Risk**: Payment processor issues affecting user deposits/withdrawals
- **Mitigation**: Multiple payment processors, clear communication protocols

### 8.4 Market Risks
- **Risk**: Competition from established platforms
- **Mitigation**: Focus on user experience, unique features, community building

